Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: mt6375: integrate reporting and bounded charger controls

Adapt the MT6375 MFD to its regmap API and shared charger interface.
Retain bounded bus writes for charger controls and TCPC shipping bits;
the firmware configuration whitelist is selected separately.

